WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.701
Why does swapping the two preimages preserve the answer?

00:00:03.981 --> 00:00:06.913
The powers reverse, and the paired weights match.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.742
Finally, swap z and its reciprocal.

00:00:11.052 --> 00:00:13.606
The four terms trade places in pairs.

00:00:13.916 --> 00:00:18.386
The midpoint stays put, and the arrows still add up to the same value.

